#: lib/installer.php
#| msgid ""
#| "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data "
#| "Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or "
#| "arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the "
#| "corresponding Data Sources will be immediatly disabled until the "
#| "administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgid ""
"The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data "
"Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or "
"arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the "
"corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the "
"administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr ""
"Vitlistning fungerar så att när du importerar eller importerar om en "
"datainmatningsmetod och skriptet eller argumenten ändras på något sätt, "
"inaktiveras datainmatningsmetoden och alla motsvarande datakällor omedelbart"
" tills administratören har bekräftat att datainmatningsmetoden är giltig."

