#: lib/utility.php
#| msgid ""
#| "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on "
#| "either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accomodate "
#| "abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your "
#| "systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can"
#| " net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgid ""
"This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on "
"either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate "
"abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your "
"systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can"
" net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr ""
"Den här inställningen bör förbli PÅ om inte dina Cacti-instanser körs på ZFS"
" eller FusionI/O, som båda har intern journalföring för att hantera "
"plötsliga systemkrascher. Om du har tillförlitlig strömförsörjning, systemen"
" sällan stannar och du har säkerhetskopior, kan AV ge nästan 50 % högre "
"databasprestanda."

