#: plugins.php
msgid ""
"Plugin directory is missing.  Click to Force Uninstall and remove all of its"
" entries from the Cacti plugin tables."
msgstr ""
"Insticksmodulens katalog saknas. Klicka på Tvinga avinstallation för att ta "
"bort alla dess poster från Cactis tabeller för insticksmoduler."

#: plugins.php
#| msgid "Are you sure you want to Uninstall?"
msgid "Are you sure you want to Force Uninstall the plugin"
msgstr "Är du säker på att du vill tvinga avinstallationen av insticksmodulen"

#: plugins.php
#| msgid ""
#| "Uninstalling this Plugin will remove all Plugin Data and Settings.  If you "
#| "really want to Uninstall the Plugin, click 'Uninstall' below.  Otherwise "
#| "click 'Cancel'"
msgid ""
"This permanently removes all of its entries from the Cacti plugin tables "
"(configuration, hooks, permissions, and any tables or columns it created).  "
"This can not be undone.  If you really want to Force Uninstall the Plugin, "
"click 'Force Uninstall' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr ""
"Detta tar permanent bort alla dess poster från Cactis tabeller för "
"insticksmoduler, inklusive konfiguration, kopplingar, behörigheter samt "
"tabeller eller kolumner som modulen har skapat. Det går inte att ångra. "
"Klicka på 'Tvinga avinstallation' nedan om du vill fortsätta. Klicka annars "
"på 'Avbryt'."

#: plugins.php
#| msgid "Uninstall Plugin"
msgid "Force Uninstall Plugin"
msgstr "Tvinga avinstallation av insticksmodul"

#: plugins.php
#| msgid "Uninstall"
msgid "Force Uninstall"
msgstr "Tvinga avinstallation"

#: plugins.php
